化 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span></span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;Layer-7：部署：sandbox/docker， vpn/tailscale &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1063">17:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;Layer-8: 仪表盘，成本优化 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span></span><br><span>5. 第四部分，应用场景 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span></span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;ERP: Obsedian 整理会议记录，提炼用户需求， frappe 对接 ERP &nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;自媒体：AI 操控浏览器 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1423">23:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span></span><br><span>6. 本系列结束语 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;下一个系列不是短视频，而是教程文章＋范例源代码，逐个讲解各个技术要素的实操。</span></code></pre>]]></description>
